      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5e1f737e6c35a44664649bde|full_name}: Yea having it as default on the left stick click might not work for all vr controllers but there are unused inputs on every controller now that either things could be shifted around or this binding could be made available to assign. \nAlternatively if they aren't going to standardise the controller bindings across every controller there is nothing stopping them from putting it on controllers that have it available. For example gesture toggle could have easily been added to multiple vr controllers by now.",
