      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly the left thumbstick click should follow the Valve knuckles and enable/disable gesture animations, on all controller types. Its  extremely useful.\nThat being said, I do agree that being able to toggle the crouched/prone state with a button would also be useful; I always feel like I have to be extra careful when I lay down on the floor or get up from it, so as to not damage my gear.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
